# Build-context ignore file for week9/Dockerfile. BuildKit reads it in place of
# a root .dockerignore, so the repo root stays untouched.
# Ignore everything, then allow only what the image copies.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/underwriting
!week9/__init__.py
!week9/risk_agent
!week9/fixtures
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
